	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Keyword "awslogin" opens a new kitty window and runs `aws sso login --profile` for each Factify profile sequentially: factify-dev, factify-prod, factify-staging, factify-sandbox, factify-root, identity-terraform. The first profile opens the browser for SSO authentication; subsequent ones auto-complete using the cached session token.</string>
